{"v":5,"savedAt":1793889854013,"project":{"name":"NHT_CustomDolls","author":"","packageId":"Andromeda.NHT.AnatomyPatch","note":"以 Nice Health Tab 模组 1.6 默认体型为基准制作的部位补丁。","aboutXml":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\r\n<ModMetaData>\r\n\t<name>Nice Health Tab - Custom Race Dolls</name>\r\n\t<author>atian</author>\r\n\t<packageId>atian.nht.customdolls</packageId>\r\n\t<supportedVersions>\r\n\t\t<li>1.7</li>\r\n\t</supportedVersions>\r\n\t<description>给 Nice Health Tab 的解剖面板换上「自己画的」娃娃与发型，并附带一个网页编辑器（Editor 文件夹）。\r\n\r\n【能做什么】\r\n· 种族娃娃：一个种族一套娃娃（HumanlikeDoll + 部位），运行时自动识别并替换；\r\n· 体型 / 性别：默认全部使用该种族补丁里的娃娃；也可以在 选项 → NHT 自定义娃娃 里\r\n  按「默认 / 男 / 女 / 指定体型」单独指定，或改用 Nice Health Tab 自带的原版体型娃娃；\r\n· 自定义部位：翅膀、尾巴、角这类种族自带部位直接绑它们自己的序号，\r\n  人类共有的部位沿用 0–63，编辑器里会按对照表自动换算；\r\n· 64+ 部位：NHT 没给对照表的自定义身体，本模组会按部位名自动生成一份，\r\n  所以尾巴这类 64 号以后的部位也能画、也有悬停信息；\r\n· HAR 头发：HAR 种族（Miho / Milira / Kiiro / Wolfein …）的附加件头发由本模组绘制，\r\n  层级来自补丁里的 HairFitDef（头发画在第一个「图层 ≥ 头发层级」的部位之前，\r\n  所以图层更高的耳朵会盖在头发上）；\r\n· 非 HAR 发型显示颜色：原版 HairDef 种族（RatKin 等）可开启「发型重绘」按发色补画一层；\r\n· 编辑器：画布分组、部位拖动 / 缩放 / 旋转、命中框、置顶重画、参考发型、素材库、\r\n  多选注入、导出纯模组文件夹、本地服务保存、可自行编辑的指南 / 通知 / 提示。\r\n\r\n【需要】\r\n· Harmony\r\n· Nice Health Tab（本模组依赖它的娃娃系统）\r\n· 与 HAR（Humanoid Alien Races）搭配时请让它先加载。\r\n\r\n【版本】\r\n· 当前 DLL 按 1.7 编译（Assemblies/NHT_CustomDolls.dll）；\r\n· 1.6 需要单独编译一份 DLL（1.6 是 Mono/.NET Framework，1.7 是 .NET），\r\n  补丁与编辑器本体与版本无关，可以共用。\r\n\r\n【怎么用】\r\n1. Mod 设置里不用动就已是「全部使用种族补丁」；\r\n2. 加新种族：双击 Editor\\启动编辑器.bat → 导入种族 → 调部位 / 发型 → 导出页注入模组；\r\n3. 详细操作见 Editor\\说明.txt 与编辑器里的「指南」。</description>\r\n\t<modDependencies>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<packageId>brrainz.harmony</packageId>\r\n\t\t\t<displayName>Harmony</displayName>\r\n\t\t\t<steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/2009463077</steamWorkshopUrl>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<packageId>Andromeda.NiceHealthTab</packageId>\r\n\t\t\t<displayName>Nice Health Tab</displayName>\r\n\t\t\t<steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/3328729902</steamWorkshopUrl>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</modDependencies>\r\n\t<loadAfter>\r\n\t\t<li>brrainz.harmony</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Andromeda.NiceHealthTab</li>\r\n\t\t<li>erdelf.HumanoidAlienRaces</li>\r\n\t</loadAfter>\r\n\t<modVersion>0.2</modVersion>\n</ModMetaData>\r\n"},"active":"race-mvyfakry","flags":{"grid":true,"hitbox":false,"icons":false,"hairPreview":false,"outline":false,"guides":false,"notes":false,"notifAck":false,"barCollapsed":true},"kinds":{"organ":false,"bone":false},"wins":{"anus":{"x":1209,"y":81,"w":157,"pin":true,"parts":{"anus":{"x":-82.4,"y":277.6},"rjw:Anus":{"x":0.6,"y":8,"w":104.8}}},"crotch":{"x":1189,"y":302,"w":202,"pin":false,"parts":{"vagina":{"x":-4.3,"y":6.1},"gonad":{"x":-120.5,"y":138.2},"ovary":{"x":18.9,"y":70.5},"womb":{"x":-5.6,"y":-59.5}}},"hand":{"x":1172,"y":531,"w":118,"pin":false,"parts":{"HandBaseRight":{"x":113,"y":40.5},"MiddleLeft":{"x":-97,"y":-56.3}},"hidden":true},"feet":{"x":1170,"y":689,"w":120,"pin":true,"parts":{"FeetBaseRight":{"x":97.2,"y":17.3}},"hidden":true},"handL":{"x":1172,"y":468,"w":108,"pin":true,"parts":{}},"handR":{"x":null,"y":null,"w":108,"pin":true,"parts":{}},"feetL":{"x":1172,"y":634,"w":108,"pin":true,"parts":{}},"feetR":{"x":null,"y":null,"w":108,"pin":true,"parts":{}},"__half2":true},"customAssets":[{"p":"Milira/Pawn/Head/MiliraHead5_south","w":512,"h":512},{"p":"Custom/Rot/MiliraHalo_south_r-41","n":"MiliraHalo_south_r-41","w":168,"h":175,"catName":"Rot","cat":"mine","g":"我的素材"},{"p":"Custom/Milira/LeftWingFront2_south","n":"LeftWingFront2_south","w":163,"h":280,"catName":"Milira","cat":"mine","g":"我的素材"},{"p":"Custom/Milira/RightWingFront2_south","n":"RightWingFront2_south","w":163,"h":280,"catName":"Milira","cat":"mine","g":"我的素材"},{"p":"Custom/Milira/elf_ear_left3","n":"elf_ear_left3","w":52,"h":34,"catName":"Milira","cat":"mine","g":"我的素材"},{"p":"Custom/Milira/elf_ear_right2","n":"elf_ear_right2","w":54,"h":34,"catName":"Milira","cat":"mine","g":"我的素材"},{"p":"Custom/Miho/MihoTail2","n":"MihoTail2","w":707,"h":1295,"catName":"Mi